The timetable (GTFS), the real-time trip updates and the service alerts
(GTFS-RT) come from the open data of the TaM, the public transport of
Montpellier Méditerranée Métropole, published on
https://transport.data.gouv.fr/datasets/offre-de-transport-tam-en-temps-reel-gtfs-rt-urbain-et-suburbain
under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Source: TaM, Montpellier
Méditerranée Métropole. The widgets show the source (TaM) and the time of
each reading. The files under test/fixtures are extracts of these data, kept
under the same licence.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
TaM (Transports de l'agglomération de Montpellier) or Montpellier Méditerranée
Métropole.
